    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nThe Add Income button is already wired up. Use it as a model to build another button.\r\n\r\n1. Look at `addIncome` in `script.js`. Notice the named arrow function and how it's connected.\r\n\r\n2. Open `spec.md` and pick one button to build.\r\n\r\n3. Under your chosen spec in `spec.md`, finish the two sentences (`[Specify]` and `[Predict]`).\r\n\r\n4. Highlight your button's full spec (including what you wrote) and send it to AI Tutor. Ask for a named arrow function.\r\n\r\n5. Write an `addEventListener` line to connect your function, then click the button to test it.",
    "display_name": "Student Budgeter",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>Budgetly</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"phone\">\n\n    <!-- Top bar with brand + user -->\n    <header class=\"app-header\">\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\">$</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\">budgetly</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"user-chip\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\">K</span>\n        <span class=\"username\">@kaiya</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Mood / vibe tag -->\n    <div class=\"vibe-tag\">\n      <span class=\"vibe-emoji\">✨</span>\n      this week's vibe: trying to save\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Big balance card -->\n    <section class=\"balance-card\">\n      <p class=\"balance-label\">your balance</p>\n      <p class=\"balance-amount\">$<span id=\"totalDisplay\">0</span></p>\n      <div class=\"balance-meta\">\n        <span class=\"meta-pill pill-green\">+ $0 today</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-pill pill-yellow\">goal: $200</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Action buttons -->\n    <section class=\"actions\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">quick moves</h2>\n      <div class=\"button-grid\">\n        <button id=\"addIncomeButton\" class=\"btn btn-income\">\n          <span class=\"btn-icon\">💸</span>\n          <span class=\"btn-label\">add income</span>\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"coffeeButton\" class=\"btn btn-coffee\">\n          <span class=\"btn-icon\">☕</span>\n          <span class=\"btn-label\">coffee<br><span class=\"btn-sub\">$5</span></span>\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"lunchButton\" class=\"btn btn-lunch\">\n          <span class=\"btn-icon\">🥗</span>\n          <span class=\"btn-label\">lunch<br><span class=\"btn-sub\">$12</span></span>\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"resetButton\" class=\"btn btn-reset\">\n          <span class=\"btn-icon\">↻</span>\n          <span class=\"btn-label\">reset</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Decorative recent transactions -->\n    <section class=\"recent\">\n      <div class=\"recent-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">recent</h2>\n        <span class=\"recent-link\">see all →</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"transaction-list\">\n        <li class=\"tx-item\">\n          <div class=\"tx-icon tx-icon-pink\">🧋</div>\n          <div class=\"tx-info\">\n            <div class=\"tx-title\">boba w/ maya</div>\n            <div class=\"tx-meta\">sip happens · sat</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"tx-amount tx-out\">−$7</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"tx-item\">\n          <div class=\"tx-icon tx-icon-green\">💼</div>\n          <div class=\"tx-info\">\n            <div class=\"tx-title\">babysitting</div>\n            <div class=\"tx-meta\">the patel kids · fri</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"tx-amount tx-in\">+$45</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"tx-item\">\n          <div class=\"tx-icon tx-icon-purple\">🎧</div>\n          <div class=\"tx-info\">\n            <div class=\"tx-title\">spotify premium</div>\n            <div class=\"tx-meta\">monthly · thu</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"tx-amount tx-out\">−$11</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"tx-item\">\n          <div class=\"tx-icon tx-icon-yellow\">🍕</div>\n          <div class=\"tx-info\">\n            <div class=\"tx-title\">tony's on 5th</div>\n            <div class=\"tx-meta\">post-practice slice · thu</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"tx-amount tx-out\">−$6</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  background: #fff4d6;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 24px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.phone {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 380px;\n  background: #fffaec;\n  border: 2.5px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 28px;\n  padding: 20px 18px 24px;\n  box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n/* ─── App header ─── */\n.app-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.brand-mark {\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 32px;\n  background: #00d26a;\n  border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.brand-name {\n  font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.user-chip {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 3px 10px 3px 3px;\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.avatar {\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 24px;\n  background: #ff6bcb;\n  border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.username {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n/* ─── Vibe tag ─── */\n.vibe-tag {\n  background: #1a1a1a;\n  color: #fff4d6;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 7px 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.vibe-emoji {\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n/* ─── Balance card ─── */\n.balance-card {\n  background: #c5f5d4;\n  border: 2.5px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 20px 22px 22px;\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.balance-label {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  text-transform: lowercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n.balance-amount {\n  font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 56px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.balance-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.meta-pill {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.pill-green { background: #ffffff; }\n.pill-yellow { background: #ffe14d; }\n\n/* ─── Section titles ─── */\n.section-title {\n  font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 17px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n/* ─── Action buttons ─── */\n.actions {\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.button-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  border: 2.5px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 14px 14px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  text-align: left;\n  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #1a1a1a;\n  transition: transform 0.08s ease, box-shadow 0.08s ease;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.btn-icon {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.btn-label {\n  font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n.btn-sub {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.btn-income { background: #00d26a; grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n.btn-coffee { background: #ffb38a; }\n.btn-lunch  { background: #c4b5fd; }\n.btn-reset  { background: #ffffff; grid-column: 1 / -1; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; }\n\n.btn-reset .btn-icon { font-size: 18px; }\n\n/* ─── Recent transactions ─── */\n.recent-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.recent-link {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n.transaction-list {\n  list-style: none;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.tx-item {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.tx-icon {\n  width: 38px;\n  height: 38px;\n  border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  transform: rotate(-3deg);\n}\n\n.tx-icon-pink   { background: #ffd1ec; }\n.tx-icon-green  { background: #c5f5d4; }\n.tx-icon-purple { background: #e0d4ff; }\n.tx-icon-yellow { background: #ffe14d; }\n\n.tx-info {\n  flex: 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.tx-title {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.tx-meta {\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  opacity: 0.55;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.tx-amount {\n  font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n.tx-in  { color: #00a056; }\n.tx-out { color: #1a1a1a; }",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// State variable for the balance\nlet balance = 0;\n\n// Get reference to the display element\nconst totalDisplay = document.getElementById('totalDisplay');\n\n// Named arrow function: adds income to the balance\nconst addIncome = () => {\n  balance = balance + 10;\n  totalDisplay.textContent = balance;\n};\n\n// Connect the function to the Add Income button\nconst addIncomeButton = document.getElementById('addIncomeButton');\naddIncomeButton.addEventListener('click', addIncome);\n\n// === Add your code below ===\n\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "spec.md",
          "contents": "---\nName of Button: Add Income   ← Already done as the example\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: Increase the balance\nWhat on the page changes: The balance display goes up\n---\n\n\nName of Button: Coffee\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: A coffee purchase is recorded\nWhat on the page changes: The balance display updates\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n\nName of Button: Lunch\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: A lunch purchase is recorded\nWhat on the page changes: The balance display updates\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n\nName of Button: Reset\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: Reset everything to start over\nWhat on the page changes: The balance returns to its starting state\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "4",
        "3"
      ]
    },
